{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"From grey: \nHey is it ok if Nolan was from Roanoke? Not the town or anything, just born in a cave near the area (I thought it fit with the croatoan touched). He doesn’t have any special knowledge of the area, just that he was in the Virginia colony in a cave.\n\nIf that isn’t okay, I can definitely have him be from a different area in Virginia?","created_at":"2021-07-14T16:45:03.426000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T16:47:17.798000Z","id":"864910378224058388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"My resp5nse:Virgins would of course be fine. I wish I could show you every time i've had to say no to tim trying all the ways to link his character to ebuc, Rockman or leaf. Even those who took the liberty of doing it despite all of my best attempts to quash it like seraxa having a hex blood link to a roanoke hag, I guided toward a pact with huginn and Muninn. I understand and appreciate every ones love and nostalgia for that wonderful island, but references belong to the dms to give out in equal measure nods to the things and moments. On the other  hand. Your backstory however may contain as much Croatoan as you'd like. Similarly, reffernces to the sub and england are not specifically baned. I'm absolutely open to trying to find you a compromise that doesn't give you something that I haven't barred other players from doing.","created_at":"2021-07-14T16:47:41.826000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T16:48:18.052000Z","id":"864911042601811980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
