{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"A few questions I have, and maybe radar or someone worked it out.\n\nAre they dieing and retiring the characters?  If not...\n\nWe haven't let a player pick a race to come back as.  We have sometimes allowed them to say no, but thats about it.\n\nSecond if they both die, then who is bringing them back like that.  The ravens wod require 2 more.  Heore doesn't use either of those races.  Would they both be making a fey deal to go to those races?\n\nAgain it might be they worked it out with radar ahead, but if not... it doesn't seem to follow the rules we already have in place (tho new rules can always be made).  This is in no way me saying its a bad idea or a no go.... just that there are some concerns.","created_at":"2021-07-29T22:29:35.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870432901370638346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
