{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"EbucXibur — Today at 12:35 AM\nI would just like to know if I could stay in the lair, the place he feels is closest to his patron. Sewer access only to use tunnels to get to any announced events... Crane also mentioned jigsaw working on a machine. Have been sleeping in the lair for the last week. Almost considers it home now. If possible.","created_at":"2021-07-31T07:36:45.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870932989276745728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"from Cairn:\n\nok so here's the pitch. first off katie and i want to go out in an epic blaze of glory and shift our characters afterwards, at the least the racial aspects. a key part of the plan involves a romantic version of mutually assured destruction 😏\nso i got an item to propose, well two to be precise... hehe here it is:\n\n-We need 2x \"Rings of Tragic Betrothal\" (proposed homebrew item for DM approval)\n- The 2 items are paired for 2 players, respectively, who are betrothed.\n- Has same properties of \"Ring of Loyalty\": If you are reduced to zero hit points while attuned to a band of loyalty, you instantly die.\n- Has an additional property that ensures the first effect triggers for both wearers simultaneously: The two characters are vitally linked, if one would drop below 0 hitpoints, the other will take the damage instead. If the damage meets or exceeds the total combined HP, both characters will die instantly. The rings can not be removed from their bodies once attuned.\nIn the event that the ring would drop a character to 1 and the other to 0 then they manage to each have 1 HP an stay standing for the moment. (very rare occurrence, but actually possible on an odd damage amount that is one less than the combined HPs of the two characters)\nI think that's about it, unless a DM wants to riff on this and add properties, either additional downsides or perks. season to taste\noh the best part is that when we die and shift races we are going to become facsimiles of Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy\ni'd be grung i think, tbd, and she'd go beasthide shifter (boar)\noh yeah and radar wanted to let us open up a coffee shop so we are preparing to call it Sesame Treats (pun off \"sesame street\")","created_at":"2021-07-31T07:50:08.059000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870936354211635270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
